s“ – Gal turima omenyje Dievo „šventą kalną“, Jeruzalę, kurioje Dievo buvimas buvo ypatingas. Plg. Ps 2:6, 3:4, 15:1, 24:3, 43:3, 68:16, 99:9.","reference":{"chapter":121,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/lit_tpv/PSA/121.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/lit_tpv/PSA/123.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/lit_tpv/PSA/119.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}